  <title>SET SQLBUFFERING Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET SQLBUFFERING command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET SQLBUFFERING Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Specifies whether the data that is returned by a remote SQL connection is buffered.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET SQLBUFFERING ON | OFF | &amp;&lt;cMacro&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ON | OFF<tab/>ON enables buffering, OFF disables it. The value may also be a macro (&amp;) that evaluates to ON or OFF.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Remarks</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">The setting is stored in the runtime state, but the runtime does not use it at this moment.</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_VARCHARMAPPING">SET VARCHARMAPPING</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_CREATE_CONNECTION">CREATE CONNECTION</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
